            {
                "entry_id": "6bef5c0e-99a4-37a5-955c-dabb87e8313f",
                "word": "Baas",
                "pos": "name",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "0771319e-20bb-4f9c-b708-c03ac3e76efb",
                        "entry_id": "6bef5c0e-99a4-37a5-955c-dabb87e8313f",
                        "tags": [],
                        "form": "Baath"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "db5230bc-9082-4484-b65d-2943593b3909",
                        "entry_id": "6bef5c0e-99a4-37a5-955c-dabb87e8313f",
                        "tags": [
                            "transcription plus fidèle de l’arabe"
                        ],
                        "form": "Ba’th"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "51f154de-b0f7-33fc-8780-c02cef47a9b2",
                        "entry_id": "6bef5c0e-99a4-37a5-955c-dabb87e8313f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Parti politique arabe se donnant pour but l’unification des différents États arabes en une seule et grande nation."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "26b1cd01-1da4-4e8d-addd-f428c7c340a9",
                                "sense_id": "51f154de-b0f7-33fc-8780-c02cef47a9b2",
                                "text": "Le parti Baas est un parti politique panarabe, socialiste et laïc fondé en Syrie. Il est généralement admis que le parti a été créé en 1944 par les Syriens Michel Aflak et Salahedine Bitar. Le parti Baas s’empare du pouvoir en Syrie et en Irak."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5183e3f8-e319-48ec-a9c2-5224d1daf4f7",
                                "sense_id": "51f154de-b0f7-33fc-8780-c02cef47a9b2",
                                "text": "La devise du parti Baas est « Une nation arabe unique, porteuse d’un message éternel »."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fea5b59a-616d-4b27-9832-83325b0cc666",
                        "source_entry_id": "6bef5c0e-99a4-37a5-955c-dabb87e8313f",
                        "source_sense_id": "51f154de-b0f7-33fc-8780-c02cef47a9b2",
                        "target_lang_word": "Baath",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Baath",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "db22d5f5-7ada-3181-8b6c-4d2d7d515978",
                                        "entry_id": "6e09f61a-e4bb-3a64-a4a4-76d7d23c57c4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The Arab Socialist Baath Party, a secular Arab socialist political party present in several countries in the Middle East, most prominently Iraq and Syria."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "92f75bf3-b2e4-4954-9738-32d90a459f3b",
                                                "sense_id": "db22d5f5-7ada-3181-8b6c-4d2d7d515978",
                                                "text": "Today it is they that proclaim the slogan of \"federation\"—which is opposed to the Baath's postulates."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d711997c-c1d8-4f2c-a1b3-aa27833cc467",
                                                "sense_id": "db22d5f5-7ada-3181-8b6c-4d2d7d515978",
                                                "text": "Nasser had a country without a party, but the Baath was still a party without a country."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac7d2659-b08b-473f-a479-3d4522e1c603",
                                                "sense_id": "db22d5f5-7ada-3181-8b6c-4d2d7d515978",
                                                "text": "For the Party to succeed in achieving these aims, Aflaq insisted that the Baath had to be nationalist, populist, socialist and revolutionary."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a3efb8d6-1889-4abc-9f19-e00fea896cd6",
                                                "sense_id": "db22d5f5-7ada-3181-8b6c-4d2d7d515978",
                                                "text": "The Baath was small but well organized and bold, and could not be intimidated."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "95bd5915-970e-4e6b-bd26-8ad50f433ecf",
                                                "sense_id": "db22d5f5-7ada-3181-8b6c-4d2d7d515978",
                                                "text": "The Baath is an avowedly secular party that has pursued socialist economic policies and at one time was aligned with the \"godless\" Soviet Union."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0e14842-6793-4ba7-b37a-d88338e885da",
                                                "sense_id": "db22d5f5-7ada-3181-8b6c-4d2d7d515978",
                                                "text": "The 1973 War was an opportunity for decision makers to demonstrate that their work under the Baath was substantively different than their predecessors, [...]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c25b0498-a68d-45f0-af99-f34d54a6b7b7",
                                                "sense_id": "db22d5f5-7ada-3181-8b6c-4d2d7d515978",
                                                "text": "The Baath was the party of the downtrodden, stacked with minorities and the rural poor of all sects, including Sunni."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c7e73633-0af5-43a2-b21a-c09a5d5a93b9",
                                                "sense_id": "db22d5f5-7ada-3181-8b6c-4d2d7d515978",
                                                "text": "It was on this platform that the Baath would bring glory, honor, and enlightenment back to the Arab World in the wake of European colonialism."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "00d35849-9433-34a7-8ce2-2e003a0994d7",
                "word": "baas",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "53372de4-3673-3c6a-9b3e-7081f74d4b6a",
                        "entry_id": "00d35849-9433-34a7-8ce2-2e003a0994d7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Maître, patron."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d264277f-0c0a-45f4-ae0e-a8ea53992429",
                                "sense_id": "53372de4-3673-3c6a-9b3e-7081f74d4b6a",
                                "text": "Cornelia Hugo se précipita sur l’ancien sjambok du baas Pieter, un morceau de cuir d’hippopotame racorni qui musardait au milieu des fusils de chasse, au-dessus de la grande cheminée."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5c3caf91-92ff-463b-81fd-df248dd8ea76",
                                "sense_id": "53372de4-3673-3c6a-9b3e-7081f74d4b6a",
                                "text": "Oh ! C'est sûr ! a dit Abel avec colère . Le baas pourra toujours alléger ton fardeau."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "30fc1e56-5edf-4b67-8fda-f8b33721c3c2",
                                "sense_id": "53372de4-3673-3c6a-9b3e-7081f74d4b6a",
                                "text": "Généralement, cela se passait dès que le Baas était parti dans le veld ; et la Nooi prenait le fouet elle-même."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
